---
description: "FastAPI backend conventions"
globs: apps/api/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- Layers: routers (HTTP) call services (business logic), services work with the
  SQLAlchemy Session. There is no separate repositories layer. A router contains no database queries.
- Request and response schemas are Pydantic models in app/schemas/, ORM models are in app/models/.
- All dates are stored as UTC (aware, type UtcDateTime); conversion to the department's
  time zone is performed only at the API boundary.
- Types are mandatory; the mypy check must pass without new ignores.
- Endpoint example: @apps/api/app/routers/submissions.py
